#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"A volume, as Podman's -v: folder:target shares a folder of your home at "
"target, a folder of the workbox's home (absolute or ~/…); name:target gives "
"the workbox a volume of its own with that name, and target alone an unnamed "
"one, removed with it. Options: ro or rw. Can be given more than once. Not "
"your whole home, nor a folder with keys or what the host runs at login; in "
"~/.config and ~/.local, only read-only."
msgstr ""
"Un volum, com el -v de Podman: carpeta:destí comparteix una carpeta de la "
"teva carpeta personal a destí, una carpeta de la carpeta personal del "
"workbox (absolut o ~/…); nom:destí dona al workbox un volum propi amb aquest "
"nom, i destí sol, un sense nom; s'eliminen amb ell. Opcions: ro o rw. Es pot "
"indicar més d'una vegada. No la teva carpeta personal sencera, ni una "
"carpeta amb claus o amb el que el sistema executa en iniciar la sessió; a "
"~/.config i ~/.local, només de lectura."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"As the workbox's root, in /root: root only inside it, the user outside it."
msgstr "Com el root del workbox, a /root: root només a dins; a fora, l'usuari."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Color"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Created the workbox %1 (\"%2\")."
msgstr "S'ha creat el workbox %1 («%2»)."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Creates a workbox: a container that shares nothing with the host but the "
"folders given with -v.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox create c1 --name \"Client 01\" --color '#3584e4' -v ~/Clients/01:~/"
"project"
msgstr ""
"Crea un workbox: un contenidor que no comparteix res amb el sistema tret de "
"les carpetes indicades amb -v.\n"
"\n"
"Exemple:\n"
"  workbox create c1 --name \"Client 01\" --color '#3584e4' -v ~/Clients/01:~/"
"projecte"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Don't ask before removing it."
msgstr "No preguntar abans d'eliminar-lo."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Every running workbox."
msgstr "Tots els workboxes en marxa."

#: cli/main.cpp
