#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Opens a shell in a workbox, or runs a command in it (after --), starting it "
"first if it's stopped. In a terminal, a shell's background takes the "
"workbox's hue, and its prompt shows its name.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  workbox enter c1\n"
"  workbox enter c1 -- make -j4"
msgstr ""
"Obre un shell en un workbox, o hi executa una ordre (després de --), i abans "
"l'engega si està aturat. En un terminal, el fons del shell pren la tonalitat "
"del workbox i l'indicador mostra el seu nom.\n"
"\n"
"Exemples:\n"
"  workbox enter c1\n"
