#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Removed the workbox %1."
msgstr "S'ha eliminat el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Removes a workbox and its home, stopping it first if it runs: everything in "
"them is lost. Asks for its id first, or with --all, for a yes, unless --"
"yes.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox rm c1"
msgstr ""
"Elimina un workbox i la seva carpeta personal, i abans l'atura si està en "
"marxa: es perd tot el que contenen. Abans en demana l'id o, amb --all, un "
"sí, tret que es faci servir --yes.\n"
"\n"
"Exemple:\n"
"  workbox rm c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
