#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Usage: workbox <command> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Runs containers, each a separate place to work, that share nothing with the "
"host.\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  create  Create a workbox\n"
"  list    List the workboxes\n"
"  info    Show a workbox\n"
"  start   Start a workbox\n"
"  stop    Stop a workbox\n"
"  enter   Open a shell in a workbox\n"
"  rm      Remove a workbox and its home\n"
"\n"
"\"workbox <command> --help\" shows a command's options; \"workbox --"
"version\", its version."
msgstr ""
"Ús: workbox <ordre> [opcions]\n"
"\n"
"Executa contenidors, cadascun un lloc de treball a part, que no comparteixen "
"res amb el sistema.\n"
"\n"
"Ordres:\n"
"  create  Crea un workbox\n"
"  list    Llista els workboxes\n"
"  info    Mostra un workbox\n"
"  start   Engega un workbox\n"
"  stop    Atura un workbox\n"
"  enter   Obre un shell en un workbox\n"
"  rm      Elimina un workbox i la seva carpeta personal\n"
"\n"
"«workbox <ordre> --help» mostra les opcions d'una ordre; «workbox --"
"version», la seva versió."

